lass=3D"font-mono text-sm">next_fire</span>, <span class=3D"font-mono text-=
sm">describe</span>) with table-driven tests. Registry and <span class=3D"f=
ont-mono text-sm">validate_cron</span> call it; <span class=3D"font-mono te=
xt-sm">AutomationCard</span> stops parsing <span class=3D"font-mono text-sm=
">cron[4]</span> and renders a described schedule instead. <span class=3D"f=
ont-mono text-sm">cron-utils.ts</span> keeps building the expression (it is=
 the input source) but gains its own tests.</p>
