          <p><b>Problem.</b> The store holds eight responsibilities, so no =
change to any of them is local. The permission queue (dedup, pattern-set au=
to-approval, folder-grant derivation) is the one deep piece and it is burie=
d among dialog booleans. Questions, a near-identical request/reply flow, by=
pass the store entirely and live in per-page <span class=3D"font-mono text-=
sm">useState</span>. And the pure artifact functions are un-exported, so th=
eir tests run on drift-prone copies.</p>
          <p><b>Solution.</b> One request-queue module serving permissions =
and questions through the same interface (two request kinds, one adapter ea=
ch side of the seam). Export the artifact functions as their own module and=
 test the call-site wiring, which is where the staleness bugs live.</p>
